{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about tomb raiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the tomb location and start digging with your tools, collect interesting treasures or other tomb raider's personal items you found in the tomb. Sell or keep them, upgrade your tools and equipments, and dig further into the giant tomb, until you reached one of the tomb's darkest secrets as you go deeper. Many things can go wrong in the process, you choices will decide your destiny.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legends whisper of an immortal fairy, 'Snow Lady', beneath the Arctic ice. At the invitation of legendary explorer Bai Jin, you delve into glacial tombs to seek priceless treasures for her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by safehouse monitors, you dig deeper, unearthing Bai Jin's personal items carved with bloody pleas for help\u2014yet she insists they were merely lost in an avalanche.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live up to your title as the Grave Digging legend... and never fail the woman waiting in the safehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Demo version, some crucial items will not be accessible to players, and players will not be able to experience different endings due to their different choices, and the types of treasures that players can discover will also be more limited, making the Demo version more of an exploratory journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948400/extras/f3efc8e693717c81b2ce35a90e474429.poster.avif?t=1756097230\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948400/extras/f3efc8e693717c81b2ce35a90e474429.webm?t=1756097230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948400/extras/f3efc8e693717c81b2ce35a90e474429.mp4?t=1756097230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948400?t=1756097230","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948400?t=1756097230","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948400/4be82054a676473d910da0f2e3eebd39cd0317e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756097230","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948400/4be82054a676473d910da0f2e3eebd39cd0317e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756097230","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"we only have one picture with partial nudily, the rest is all about the adventure itself. And that picture is not in the demo. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about tomb raiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the tomb location and start digging with your tools, collect interesting treasures or other tomb raider's personal items you found in the tomb. Sell or keep them, upgrade your tools and equipments, and dig further into the giant tomb, until you reached one of the tomb's darkest secrets as you go deeper. Many things can go wrong in the process, you choices will decide your destiny.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legends whisper of an immortal fairy, 'Snow Lady', beneath the Arctic ice. At the invitation of legendary explorer Bai Jin, you delve into glacial tombs to seek priceless treasures for her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by safehouse monitors, you dig deeper, unearthing Bai Jin's personal items carved with bloody pleas for help\u2014yet she insists they were merely lost in an avalanche.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live up to your title as the Grave Digging legend... and never fail the woman waiting in the safehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Demo version, some crucial items will not be accessible to players, and players will not be able to experience different endings due to their different choices, and the types of treasures that players can discover will also be more limited, making the Demo version more of an exploratory journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948400/extras/f3efc8e693717c81b2ce35a90e474429.poster.avif?t=1756097230\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948400/extras/f3efc8e693717c81b2ce35a90e474429.webm?t=1756097230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948400/extras/f3efc8e693717c81b2ce35a90e474429.mp4?t=1756097230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Tide Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3816080","name":"Legendary Tomb digger"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948400/19f03da9f32e43573cdf0c2d441d79eb51f2788b/header.jpg?t=1756097230","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257181951,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181951/movie480.mp4?t=1756095235","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181951/movie_